add('DM-003','P1','Primary action labels miss normal-text contrast','Shared controls','Contrast','screenshots/current/shared-controls.component.desktop.dark.current.jpg','app/globals.css; components/ui.tsx','Primary actions use near-white labels on #4f8a5d. At ordinary button sizes the measured 4.02:1 falls below 4.5:1. This repeats across queue, dashboard and server actions.','Separate action background from accent foreground; use a darker green action fill with light text.','Every enabled primary action label ≥4.5:1; preserve hover, pressed and disabled distinctions.',{'status':'Computed, opaque','ratios':'4.02:1','foreground':'#fffdf4','background':'#4f8a5d'},'screenshots/proposed/shared-controls.component.desktop.dark.proposed-B.jpg')
add('DM-004','P1','Secondary approval actions have low contrast','AI Curator','Contrast','screenshots/annotated/ai-review.dark.annotated.jpg','app/server/ai-curator/page.tsx; secondary action color #6d7f6d','Edit then Accept uses ivory normal text on a medium sage background.','Use a dedicated secondary action role or outlined action with compliant text.','Normal action text ≥4.5:1; primary, secondary and destructive actions remain distinguishable.',{'status':'Computed, opaque','ratios':'3.47:1','foreground':'#eee7d7','background':'#6d7f6d'},'screenshots/proposed/shared-controls.component.desktop.dark.proposed-B.jpg')
add('DM-005','P1','Overdue care badge is difficult to read','Care Queue','Contrast candidate','screenshots/annotated/care-overdue.dark.annotated.jpg','components/CareQueueLocationBoard.tsx: overdue badge','A fixed brown-red foreground sits over a translucent tinted background. Ancestor-composited estimate is 1.06:1; use the painted-measurements file for a localized actual-pixel cross-check.','Use paired warning or overdue tokens and retain the overdue count and text.','Validate ≥4.5:1 at actual rendered backgrounds in both themes; never rely on hue alone.',{'status':'Gradient/compositing estimate; localized painted sample supplemental','ratios':'Estimated 1.06:1','foreground':'#913e2d','background':'Estimated #674e48'},'screenshots/proposed/care-queue.desktop.dark.proposed-B.jpg')
add('DM-006','P1','Care group metadata sits on a washed surface','Care Queue','Contrast candidate','screenshots/current/care-queue.desktop.dark.current-detail.jpg','components/CareQueueLocationBoard.tsx: location group header','White-opacity layers brighten the location header while muted text remains relatively dim. Estimated metadata contrast is 2.82:1.','Give grouped headers an explicit dark surface and secondary text pair.','Location codes and group counts ≥4.5:1; nested groups remain distinct without a bright gray slab.',{'status':'Gradient/compositing estimate; painted sample supplemental','ratios':'Estimated 2.82:1','foreground':'#bdb5a5','background':'Estimated #636763'},'screenshots/proposed/care-queue.desktop.dark.proposed-B.jpg')
